{"content":"{\"chapter_contract_id\":\"contract:v2-n-3-2-1:v2\",\"node_id\":\"v2_n_3_2_1\",\"schema_version\":\"ordered_chapter_draft_candidate.v1\",\"known_evidence_ids\":[],\"blocks\":[{\"block_id\":\"blk_v2_n_3_2_1_001\",\"kind\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"3.2.1 次要目的\",\"evidence_refs\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"},{\"block_id\":\"blk_v2_n_3_2_1_002\",\"kind\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"本试验次要目的应逐项与已定义的次要终点对应，并明确其确证性或探索性分析意图。相关终点包括独立影像评估委员会（IRC）评估的缓解持续时间（DoR）、疾病控制率（DCR）、无进展生存期（PFS），总生存期（OS），安全性和耐受性，研究者按实体瘤疗效评价标准（RECIST）v1.1评估的客观缓解率（ORR），以及在可行时合成药G的药代动力学（PK）参数、抗药抗体（ADA）和中和抗体（NAb）发生率。\",\"evidence_refs\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"},{\"block_id\":\"blk_v2_n_3_2_1_003\",\"kind\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"各次要目的的确证性与探索性属性及多重性控制意图【待补充：各次要目的的确证性与探索性属性及多重性控制意图：该项待研究团队确认后补充】。在确认前，本表仅登记目的与可识别终点的对应关系，不将未确认内容表述为确证性结论。\",\"evidence_refs\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"},{\"block_id\":\"blk_v2_n_3_2_1_004\",\"kind\":\"table\",\"evidence_refs\":[],\"table\":{\"table_id\":\"tbl_v2_n_3_2_1_secondary_objectives_endpoints\",\"block_id\":\"blk_v2_n_3_2_1_004\",\"title\":\"次要目的—次要终点映射\",\"domain\":\"objectives_endpoints\",\"role\":\"body_content\",\"header_row_count\":1,\"review_state\":\"ai_draft\",\"version\":0,\"source_locator\":\"\",\"word_layout\":{},\"columns\":[{\"column_id\":\"col_secondary_objective\",\"label\":\"次要目的\",\"order\":0,\"semantic_role\":\"objective\",\"style_role\":\"body\"},{\"column_id\":\"col_secondary_endpoint\",\"label\":\"对应次要终点/评估\",\"order\":1,\"semantic_role\":\"endpoint\",\"style_role\":\"body\"}],\"rows\":[{\"row_id\":\"row_sec_obj_001\",\"order\":0,\"cells\":[{\"cell_id\":\"secondary:cell:objective\",\"row_id\":\"row_sec_obj_001\",\"column_id\":\"col_secondary_objective\",\"text\":\"评价IRC评估的缓解持续时间（DoR）、疾病控制率（DCR）和无进展生存期（PFS）。\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\",\"style_role\":\"body\"},{\"cell_id\":\"secondary:cell:endpoint\",\"row_id\":\"row_sec_obj_001\",\"column_id\":\"col_secondary_endpoint\",\"text\":\"IRC评估的DoR、DCR和PFS；具体删失规则应在统计分析计划（SAP）中预先定义。\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\",\"style_role\":\"body\"}]},{\"row_id\":\"row_sec_obj_002\",\"order\":1,\"cells\":[{\"cell_id\":\"cell_sec_obj_002_objective\",\"row_id\":\"row_sec_obj_002\",\"column_id\":\"col_secondary_objective\",\"text\":\"评价总生存期（OS）。\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\",\"style_role\":\"body\"},{\"cell_id\":\"cell_sec_obj_002_endpoint\",\"row_id\":\"row_sec_obj_002\",\"column_id\":\"col_secondary_endpoint\",\"text\":\"OS；在本随机II期设计中通常仅作描述性分析，不作为主要疗效决策依据。\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\",\"style_role\":\"body\"}]},{\"row_id\":\"row_sec_obj_003\",\"order\":2,\"cells\":[{\"cell_id\":\"cell_sec_obj_003_objective\",\"row_id\":\"row_sec_obj_003\",\"column_id\":\"col_secondary_objective\",\"text\":\"评价试验参与者的安全性和耐受性，包括治疗中出现的不良事件（TEAE）、严重不良事件（SAE）、特别关注不良事件（AESI）、输液反应、剂量暂停或下调、因毒性终止治疗及死亡。\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\",\"style_role\":\"body\"},{\"cell_id\":\"cell_sec_obj_003_endpoint\",\"row_id\":\"row_sec_obj_003\",\"column_id\":\"col_secondary_endpoint\",\"text\":\"安全性和耐受性终点，包括TEAE、SAE、AESI、输液反应、剂量暂停或下调、因毒性终止治疗及死亡。\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\",\"style_role\":\"body\"}]},{\"row_id\":\"row_sec_obj_004\",\"order\":3,\"cells\":[{\"cell_id\":\"cell_sec_obj_004_objective\",\"row_id\":\"row_sec_obj_004\",\"column_id\":\"col_secondary_objective\",\"text\":\"评价研究者按RECIST v1.1评估的ORR，作为IRC评估的敏感性和一致性分析。\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\",\"style_role\":\"body\"},{\"cell_id\":\"cell_sec_obj_004_endpoint\",\"row_id\":\"row_sec_obj_004\",\"column_id\":\"col_secondary_endpoint\",\"text\":\"研究者按RECIST v1.1评估的ORR；用于IRC评估的敏感性和一致性分析。\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\",\"style_role\":\"body\"}]},{\"row_id\":\"row_sec_obj_005\",\"order\":4,\"cells\":[{\"cell_id\":\"cell_sec_obj_005_objective\",\"row_id\":\"row_sec_obj_005\",\"column_id\":\"col_secondary_objective\",\"text\":\"在可行时评价合成药G的PK参数以及ADA/NAb发生率。\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_lo